   PGM
   /**************************************************************/
   /*** CLUPDQA - THIS PROCEDURE IS USED TO UPDATE THE VALUES  ***/
   /***           IN THE QA ENVIRONMENT.                       ***/
   /***           REQUEST 2004-77306                           ***/
   /**************************************************************/

             CHGJOB     LOG(4 0 *SECLVL) LOGCLPGM(*YES)

             CHGCURLIB  CURLIB(MCQA1)

   /* CALL COBOL PROGRAM TUPDQA TO UPDATE PLANT STARTUP VALUES.      */
             CALL       PGM(TUPDQA)

   /* CALL SQL PROGRAM SQLUPDQA TO UPDATE OTHER QA FILES.            */
             CALL       PGM(SQLUPDQA)

             ENDPGM
